  "Replication on >=1 non-stdlib corpus with >>4 domains and natural length-domain joint to establish generality beyond this single n=3329 corpus (theory_skeptic)",
  "Comparison against chunked/local sorting (global-shuffle then sort within 10k-100k chunks) which is the actual production practice — global sort may be a strawman (evaluation_prosecutor)"
]
