  "Length-stratified-shuffle (same length distribution per batch but domain-randomized) — theory_skeptic, unrebutted",
  "Random-reshuffling / data-order variance literature (Gürbüzbalaban et al.; arXiv:1708.01383, 2007.03509) — novelty_killer mandatory related work",
  "HF Trainer group_by_length + fairseq sortish-sampler — novelty_killer mandatory related work, systems_reviewer corroborates",
  "Zhang et al. arXiv:2410.21676 critical-batch-size scaling — novelty_killer mandatory related work",
  "NeMo first_fit_decreasing vs first_fit_shuffle (ships the operational contrast already) — systems_reviewer"
