PRIOR_ART_ADEQUATE: yes
RATIONALE: Unanimous YELLOW from all 5 reviewers on independent grounds that converge on three findings. (1) MECHANISM IS REAL BUT EXPECTED: the novelty_killer verified via >=2 independent sources that no single paper pre-empts the exact measured pathway (length-sort -> domain-correlated batches -> entropy collapse -> GNS inflation), so no KILL — but the three constituent facts (length-bucketing breaks IID [group_by_length/sortish-sampler, verified], non-IID batches change gradient variance [reshuffling literature, >=2 sources], GNS measures it [McCandlish]) are each independently established. The theory_skeptic corroborates: "Non-IID estimator changes when assumption is violated" is textbook, predicted in direction and rough magnitude. The contribution is synthesis + quantification, not discovery; "effective-batch tax" is a new name, not a new phenomenon. The novelty_killer's reframing requirement is warranted. (2) EFFECT IS BOUNDED AND REGIME-NARROW: all reviewers agree the >=1.3 headline is unsupported. Realistic ratios are 1.22 (dpp=2.0, CI excludes 1.0) -> 1.17 (dpp=3.1, CI includes 1.0) -> 1.10 (dpp=5.8, CI[0.772,1.545]). The theory_skeptic notes only 1 of 3 MAXLEN points is statistically significant; the "monotone decay" is visually suggestive on 3 points with wide CIs, not statistically established. The product_realist notes production pretraining typically packs dense (dpp>>5), where the effect vanishes. The systems_reviewer notes NeMo already ships the operational contrast (first_fit_decreasing vs first_fit_shuffle) with a convergence warning. (3) CRITICAL CONTROLS MISSING: the theory_skeptic's length-stratified-shuffle confound is the most damaging unrebutted objection — without it, the "domain diversity collapse" causal claim is correlational (length-homogeneity and domain-homogeneity are aliased). The evaluation_prosecutor's chunked-sort strawman concern is likewise unrebutted — if production practice is chunk-sort not global-sort, the L0 attacks a non-existent regime. The frozen-tiny-model limitation is flagged by all reviewers and acknowledged by the researcher. NOT RED because: the L0 was conducted honestly (pre-registered, anti-circular guard honored, PARTIAL verdict matches data, null exits explicitly adjudicated), the mechanism direction is confirmed (entropy diagnostic aligns), and the anti-hallucination rule was honored (real corpus, real gradients, frozen identical model, measured MI). The PARTIAL/keep-exploring status is earned — but promotion to L1 requires all five items in REQUIRED_EVIDENCE. NOT GREEN because: (a) prior-art search was adequate but FOUND that the mechanism is synthesis of known results, (b) the effect is regime-narrow and sub-headline, (c) two unrebutted confounds (length-vs-domain aliasing, global-vs-chunked-sort strawman) block causal interpretation, (d) frozen-model GNS cannot bound real-training GNS (all reviewers). The honest PARTIAL is the correct status; the L0 demonstrated that the effect EXISTS in a narrow regime but is BOUNDED by within-pack averaging — both findings are valuable. L1 gate: resolve the five REQUIRED_EVIDENCE items before committing real GPU budget. Prompt version: v001.
